 igest submission (extended): 13 Mar 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nConfe
 rence: October 4-8\, 2026\nLocation: Vancouver\, Canada\n\nAll dates:\n  D
 igest submission (extended): 13 Mar 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Autho
 r notification: 22 May 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Final paper with I
 EEE copyright form: 10 Jul 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe call for p
 apers states no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it coul
 d plausibly mean\, so the countdown runs out before the real deadline rath
 er than after it.\n\nDigests are single-column\, at most five pages includ
 ing references\, and are double-blind reviewed. The submission deadline wa
 s extended from 27 February to 13 March 2026.\n\nCall for papers: https://
 www.ieee-ecce.org/2026/\nDetails: https://langestefan.github.io/powersyste
 m-deadlines/conference/ecce26
